@startuml
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
title Activity Diagram: UC-05 Manage Cake Design

|Customer|
start
label design_start
:[Step 1.0] Select "Design" from navigation bar;
:[Step 1.0] Input design preferences\n(text, flavor, size, colors, occasion);
:[Step 2.0] Submit design request;

|AI System|
:[Step 1.1] Receive design preferences;
if (Required parameters complete?) then (Yes)
  if (Valid inputs & available ingredients/themes?) then (Yes)
    :[Step 2.1] Generate visual preview image(s)\nusing generative-AI model;
  else (No / Unavailable)
    |System|
    :[Exc 1.1.1] Prompt for clarification or\nsuggest available alternatives;
    detach
  endif
else (No / Incomplete)
  |System|
  :[Exc 1.1.1] Prompt for missing required parameters;
  detach
endif

|System|
if (AI Generation Successful?) then (Yes)
  :[Step 2.2] Display generated preview(s) to Customer;
else (No / Failure)
  :[Exc 2.1.1] Notify Customer & offer to retry or\nconnect with staff for manual consultation;
  detach
endif

|Customer|
repeat
  :[Step 3.1] Review AI-generated cake design preview(s);
  
  if (User Action?) then (Ask Question)
    :[Step 4.0] Use AI Chatbot to ask clarifying question;
    |System|
    :[Step 4.0] Perform Interact with AI Chatbot;
    :[Step 4.1] Minimize/close chatbot window & keep\nCustomer on current design page;
    |Customer|
  elseif (Request Adjustments) then (Request Changes)
    :[Step 5.0] Request design adjustments\n(color, decorations, size/tier);
    |AI System|
    :[Step 5.1] Regenerate updated preview(s)\nbased on requested changes;
    |System|
    :[Step 5.2] Display updated preview(s);
    |Customer|
  else (Proceed)
    :[Step 6.0] Select preferred design;
    break
  endif
repeat while (Customer wants to refine design?)

:[Step 6.1] Submit finalized design for review;

|System|
:[Step 6.1] Order/Save finalized design;
:[Step 6.2] Notify Staff/Admin that custom design\nis ready for feasibility review;

|Staff/Admin|
:[Step 7.0] Review saved design against ingredient\navailability and preparation feasibility;

if (Feasibility Check?) then (Approved)
  |System|
  :[Step 7.1] Update design status to "Approved";
  :[Step 7.1] Send notification to Customer;
  |Customer|
  :[Step 8.0] Select "Add to Cart" / "Order This Design";
  |System|
  :[Step 8.1] Perform Manage Order use case\n(attach theme, size, flavor, price details);
  stop
else (Declined)
  |System|
  :[Exc 7.1.1] Update status to "Declined - Design Not Possible";
  :[Exc 7.1.1] Send notification to Customer with explanation\nand prompt to submit alternative design;
  detach
endif

@enduml
